  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><sup><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/en/product/492540/diamond-spheres-harmony-and-discord?affiliate_id=3028400\">Diamond Spheres: Harmony &amp; Discord</a></sup></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Performance sphere (Captivating Spectacle [utility]), associated ranks 5.</p>\n<p>Whenever you use the entertain skill use, creatures that would be distracted by you are instead oblivious to everything except you (if you choose).</p>\n<p>Whenever you reduce a creature’s state of awareness, you can choose to have the creature’s memory of you become foggy, causing them to not be able to recall specific details about you except about your beauty or skill as a performer.</p>\n<p>You can spend 1 use of skill leverage whenever you make a creature fascinated by you to have it be difficult to shake. The fascinated creature does not lose the fascinated condition if they see an obvious threat, and instead receive a new saving throw against the effect, although they break free if they are damaged.</p>\n<p>Additionally, a creature attempting to shake the fascinated creature free of the condition must spend 1 round doing so instead of a standard action.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/performance#toc67\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
